    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d875-a1">

                <pb facs="1011" n="917" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg917"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1, in No. 945.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Poche to Mr. Terrell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Aleppo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Nine prisoners exhausted their means and claim help. Vali informed. Says he can
                    not allow more than 300 drams (3 pounds) of bread according to regulation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Poche.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>N. B.—Three of the nine prisoners mentioned have not proved their
                        naturalization.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
